# Architecture and Recurring Flows

## Current state

Bootstrap deliberately does not infer architecture from directory names. No durable ownership boundary or recurring cross-layer flow has been verified yet.

## How to add a durable fact

Use this shape after inspecting code, then add the actual record as ordinary Markdown lines outside this fenced example:

```text
Fact: <stable ownership rule or recurring flow>
Evidence: `<path>`, `<symbol/route/schema/test>`
Confidence: confirmed
Last verified: <commit or date>
```

Keep task-specific call traces in the task analysis, not in this project companion.
